---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Siddhant Dembi"
  description="About Siddhant Dembi and the technical documentation on this site."
>
  <main class="page" data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="page-header">
      <h2>About</h2>
    </header>

    <section class="about-grid">
      <p>
        I am Siddhant, and this space is where I document the systems I build,
        break, rebuild, and learn from. Most of my work sits around homelab
        infrastructure, automation, self-hosting, networking, and practical
        DevOps experiments.
      </p>

      <p>
        I like turning messy notes into clear write-ups that are useful later,
        both for me and for anyone trying to build something similar. Each
        section here is meant to be a living record of decisions, setups,
        lessons, and improvements over time.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: var(--page-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-9) 24px calc(var(--space-9) + var(--space-5));
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.75rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 5vw, var(--space-9));
    padding-top: var(--space-7);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .about-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .page {
      padding: var(--space-8) 20px var(--space-9);
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
    }

    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-5);
      padding-top: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
</style>
